                "claim": "The rings map entries were reordered so that reviewreceipt entries now precede review entries, breaking the alphabetical order the rest of the map follows. This adds diff noise and makes the map slightly harder to scan; keeping the original order and inserting review/gitexec after review/fsstore would have been a smaller change.",
