                "severity": "SUGGESTION",
                "claim": "emptyTree decides the hash function from the length of head alone, comparing against len(EmptyTreeSHA256). The inference is implicit and only valid for 40 or 64 character names; the reason for keying on head length is not stated at the function. Callers pass already validated full names, so it is not a defect, but a short comment naming that precondition would prevent misuse.",
