                "severity": "WARNING",
                "claim": "The Timeout option uses context.Background() per call, so there is no caller cancellation. A hung git is bounded only if Timeout is non-zero; the zero default means unbounded. Tests cover the deadline but not the zero default's hang risk.",
                "proof_refs": [
                  "engine/review/gitexec/gitexec.go:184-190"
